/**
 * THE RUNTIME MODULES ARE IMPORTED HERE FOR A REASON BEYOND TESTING THEM.
 * `tsconfig.json`'s `include` is `src/**` only, so a file under
 * `supabase/functions/` is typechecked ONLY when something under `src/` reaches
 * it. The first draft of `improvement.ts` called `ctx.staleness?.()` — a field
 * `SubstrateContext` has never had — and `tsc --noEmit` came back CLEAN,
 * because nothing imported the file. That is this repository's most-recorded
 * failure arriving in the typechecker itself. These imports are what put the
 * four new runtime modules into the program.
 */
